# Source: https://github.com/galenguyer/nano-syntax-highlighting/blob/6f7cb16bf238fa5c55995377ec9d1d3fa9b9515f/conf.nanorc
# License: GPL-3.0-or-later

## Here is an example for nanorc files.
##
syntax "Conf" "\.c[o]?nf$"
## Possible errors and parameters
## Strings
icolor white ""(\\.|[^"])*""
## Comments
icolor brightblue "^[[:space:]]*#.*$"
icolor cyan "^[[:space:]]*##.*$"
## Trailing spaces
color ,green "[[:space:]]+$"
